1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,140
Attention, all passengers.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,420
Love Boat Cruiselines has an important announcement about tonight's entertainment.

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:08,260
There will be a slight change of schedule.

4
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:13,055
All of you looking forward to tonight's quiz night will have to be patient.

5
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:18,560
Due to some technical problems with the sound system, quiz night has been postponed until tomorrow.

6
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,000
We sincerely apologize for this delay.

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,340
We are working to remedy the situation as soon as possible.

8
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,540
However, we do have a surprise for you.

9
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:36,540
The well-known magician John Sanders and his Magic Bus Revue will join us directly from their successful tour of Hawaii.

10
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,220
So please join us this evening: we are sure you won't be disappointed.
